WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Case 7: dates switch from US style (04/20/2026) to Australian style (20/04/2026). (Re-run recorded after the fact.)

00:06.000 --> 00:13.000
Step 2: run the same pipeline.

00:13.000 --> 00:18.000
"Pipeline completed successfully." No warning.

00:18.000 --> 00:23.000
In the Data Input profile, order_date is already a DateTime. Rhombus converted the dates while loading the file, before any cleaning.

00:23.000 --> 00:27.000
It read them month-first wherever it could, so 08/02 (8 Feb) became 2 Aug. The range now ends on 7 December 2026, in the future.

00:27.000 --> 00:30.000
Delivered to Google Cloud Storage as a success: 116 orders with swapped dates, and no warning.
